{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">本港每年大約有240宗「主動脈撕裂」個案。此症發病極為迅速且危急，患者每小時的死亡率會增加1%至2%，兩天內的致死率更高達五成。中大醫學院外科學系心胸外科組主任黃鴻亮教授在節目《重症解密》中，詳細拆解主動脈撕裂的成因、症狀及預防方法，提醒高血壓人士務必提高警覺。</p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>心臟負責將含氧血液經由主動脈供應給腦部、頭頸部、腎臟及腸胃等主要的維生組織。黃鴻亮教授指出，主動脈一旦出現撕裂，會根據受影響的血管位置，引發不同器官的嚴重併發症：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>影響冠狀動脈： 可能引發心肌梗塞。</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>影響頭頸部血管： 可能導致中風。</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>影響腎臟血管： 可能引發腎衰竭。</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>症狀分辨：主動脈撕裂 VS 心肌梗塞</strong></p><table class=\"tiptap-table\" style='margin-bottom: 32px; min-width: 75px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"/><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"/><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"tiptap-table-row\" style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">症狀特徵</p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主動脈撕裂</p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\">心肌梗塞</p></td></tr><tr class=\"tiptap-table-row\" style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>痛楚感覺</span></p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>猶如被刀割般撕心裂肺</span></p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>胸口感到翳悶、有大石壓迫感</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"tiptap-table-row\" style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>痛楚位置</span></p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>通常延伸至後背、腰腹</span></p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>延伸至下巴或左邊肩膀</span></p></td></tr><tr class=\"tiptap-table-row\" style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>發病速度</span></p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>突發性</span></p></td><td class=\"tiptap-table-cell\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style='border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>持續並逐漸加劇</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"280dd059-ba2e-4751-8ee2-c43ea396ab43.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026qn7TonIzXp1787281774.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"280dd059-ba2e-4751-8ee2-c43ea396ab43.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>當遇到疑似主動脈撕裂的緊急情況，旁人應立刻召喚救護車。以下為血管撕裂的關鍵徵狀：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ol><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>拆解主動脈撕裂3大成因</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"17405ccf-d86b-4b09-ada5-0cb163ede78e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026l44wOGne2P1787281795.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"17405ccf-d86b-4b09-ada5-0cb163ede78e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>主動脈撕裂並非長者的專利，約有20%的患者年齡在50歲以下。年輕患者的高危因素一般包括：有家族病史、基因突變，以及患有高血壓而不自知。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>治療與預防方法</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>緊急手術治療：</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>若為升主動脈撕裂，患者必須接受緊急的開胸手術。醫生需要鋸開胸骨，並藉助「體外循環機」暫代心肺功能，讓心臟停止跳動。這能為醫生爭取60至90分鐘的黃金時間，以切除病變的大動脈，並換上人造血管及支架。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>日常預防貼士：</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>想預防主動脈撕裂，改善生活習慣是關鍵：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>嚴格按醫生指示服用降血壓藥。</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>減少攝取高鹽分食物。</p></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T14:19:50.390179+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":664,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}